# proto-file: flatsat/hardware/devices.proto
# proto-message: flatsat.v1.MagnetometerDevice
#
# Magnetometer device specification — DEVICE-INTRINSIC truth: noise and
# range character the flight-side driver enforces and the simulation's
# sensor model corrupts truth with. Values are placeholder (an RM3100-class
# magneto-inductive part) until a physical magnetometer is on the bench.
#
# Deliberately absent until characterization: bias, scale factor,
# hard/soft-iron distortion — invented distortion is fiction a B-dot gain
# would then be tuned against.

name: "mag0"
rate_hz: 50.0
noise_t: 1.5e-8       # ~15 nT white-noise sigma per axis
full_scale_t: 8.0e-4  # ±800 uT; Earth's surface field is under 70 uT
lsb_t: 1.3e-8         # ~13 nT quantization
